Package: methylTFRAnnotationBuilder
Title: Build Annotation Packages for methylTFR
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(person("Irem B.", "Gunduz", email = "irembgunduz@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Builds the transcription factor binding site, motif GC
    frequency and genome-wide GC distribution annotations required by the
    methylTFR package, and scaffolds them into an installable annotation
    package for a given genome assembly.
URL: https://github.com/EpigenomeInformatics/methylTFRAnnotationBuilder
BugReports: https://github.com/EpigenomeInformatics/methylTFRAnnotationBuilder/issues
Date: 2026-08-19
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
